# Raw captures never enter the repo. They carry operator-home paths, the
# operator's global CLAUDE.md (which names them and carries their email) and
# the machine's skill/agent listings — `AGENTS.md` says to redact operator PII
# in any trace record and never to commit raw trace records.
#
# What is committed is `runs/*/evidence.json`, built by `evidence.py`: the
# record shapes, provenance fields, marker counts and short quotations the
# report asserts, redacted and re-scanned before writing, with a sha256 of each
# raw input so a re-run can be matched to what was published.
runs/*/events.jsonl
runs/*/phase*/events.jsonl
runs/*/transcript.jsonl
runs/*/transcript.provenance.json
runs/*/proxy.jsonl
runs/*/proxy.stderr.log
runs/*/stderr.log
runs/*/phase*/stderr.log
# meta.json records the resolved workdir, which is an absolute operator path.
# Its redacted copy is inside evidence.json.
runs/*/meta.json
